# sweep: --seed-root scripts/fixtures/habits/shelf
# A first run with no habits, then adding, ticking, skipping, editing,
# archiving, the backup out and back in, and the habits surviving a restart.
# The shelf holds a habits backup and a text file that is not one, because
# no companion command puts a file on Habits' shelf.
# Only daily habits are ticked here: the route runs on the real calendar, and
# a weekday habit is not due at the weekend.
wait-for Nothing due
expect Add a habit
expect-missing Yesterday
clean
shot habits-first-run
tap Streaks
wait-for No streaks yet
tap Manage
wait-for No habits yet
tap Stats
wait-for 0 completions
expect This week: nothing was due.
clean
shot habits-stats-empty
# Adding with nothing typed adds nothing.
tap Manage
wait-for No habits yet
tap-id add
wait-for Habit name
expect Use 48 characters or fewer.
tap Add
wait-for No habits yet
tap-id add
wait-for Habit name
type read
tap Add
wait-for read
tap-id add
wait-for Habit name
type stretch
tap Add
wait-for stretch
expect daily
clean
shot habits-manage
tap Today
wait-for Tap a habit when it is done.
# A tick marks a habit done, and a second tap takes it back.
tap read
wait-for Done
tap read
wait-idle
tap Stats
wait-for 0 completions
tap Today
wait-for Tap a habit when it is done.
tap read
wait-for Done
# Skipping is in the habit's own menu, and tapping a skipped habit undoes it.
tap-id menu-1
wait-for Skip today
tap Skip today
wait-for Skipped
clean
shot habits-today-done-and-skipped
tap stretch
wait-idle
expect-missing Skipped
tap Streaks
wait-for 1 current, 1 best
expect 0 current, 0 best
tap Stats
wait-for 1 completion
clean
shot habits-stats
# Rename, schedule and archive from one habit's screen.
tap Manage
wait-for stretch
tap read
wait-for How often
expect Rename
expect Archive
tap Rename
wait-for Habit name
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type walk
tap Save
wait-for walk
expect How often
tap Every 2 days
wait-idle
tap Daily
wait-idle
tap Archive
wait-for Put back
clean
shot habits-edit-archived
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for daily; archived
tap Today
wait-for stretch
expect-missing walk
tap Manage
wait-for walk
tap walk
wait-for Put back
tap Put back
wait-for Archive
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for walk
expect-missing archived
tap Today
wait-for walk
expect Done
# The backup goes out to the computer.
tap Stats
wait-for completion
tap Settings
wait-for Stored on this reader
expect A skipped day keeps it.
clean
shot habits-settings
tap Export a backup
wait-for Ready for your computer.
expect habits-backup
companion export --app habits --sim --out target/habits-route-export
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Export a backup
# The backup just exported is listed by its date, first. A file that is
# not a backup says so; a backup is offered to replace or merge.
tap Import a backup
wait-for Backup of
expect Text backup ·
expect habits-backup.txt
expect shopping-list.txt
clean
shot habits-import-choose
tap shopping-list.txt
wait-for That file has no habits this reader can import.
tap Backup of
wait-for Replace habits on this reader
tap Replace habits on this reader
wait-for The backup replaced the habits on this reader.
expect walk
clean
shot habits-import-replaced
tap Stats
wait-for completion
expect-missing The backup replaced
tap Settings
wait-for Import a backup
tap Import a backup
wait-for habits-backup.txt
tap habits-backup.txt
wait-for 3 habits
expect Replace habits on this reader
expect Merge with habits on this reader
clean
shot habits-import-confirm
tap Merge with habits on this reader
wait-for Tap a habit when it is done.
expect tea
expect walk
wait-for The backup was merged with the habits on this reader.
clean
shot habits-import-merged
